 ## Background
-This method is an experiment to generate a cubic voxel chunk mesh as efficiently as possible, leveraging Unity's compute shaders and indirect procedural drawing [S1, unofficial]. It builds on OpenGL voxelizer compute shaders by Demurzasty and GPU Noise by keijiro [S1, unofficial]. The implementation is hosted in a GitHub repository [S1, unofficial].
